"id": 1991220, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16ofo.jpg"}, {"id": 1991215, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16ofj.jpg"}, {"id": 1991221, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16ofp.jpg"}, {"id": 1991214, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16ofi.jpg"}], "slug": "shepherds-of-haven", "storyline": "Become the Hero They Fear\n\nMagic has been outlawed for centuries.\n\nPeople with supernatural gifts like yours are hated, hunted, and blamed for the world's misfortunes. But when demons return from another world, the very powers that once made you an outcast now become humanity's best hope for survival.\n\nJoin the Shepherds\u2014an elite order of demon hunters and magical operatives\u2014and defend the city of Haven from supernatural threats. Solve magical crimes, uncover ancient conspiracies, recruit powerful allies, and discover the truth behind the return of the demons.\n\nThe world once feared you.\n\nNow it needs you.\n\nWill you be the beacon of hope the world so desperately needs... or will you be the flame that burns it all down?", "summary": "A massive choice-driven, text-based fantasy RPG where you play as a persecuted Mage recruited to fight a demonic invasion. Shape your hero, recruit companions, find friendship and romance, investigate supernatural mysteries, and determine the fate of a world that fears your kind.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/shepherds-of-haven"}